[I] Python Build Reasonableness

[T] PBR is a setuptools plugin and PEP 517 build backend to manage
[T] setuptools packaging in a consistent way, deriving metadata such as the
[T] version, authors and changelog from the project and its git history.

[U] https://docs.openstack.org/pbr/latest/

